title: PowerShell Add-Type Inline C# Compilation
id: cf3f10ac-bb9a-4fc0-8886-bb2f9481129e
status: experimental
description: Detects PowerShell Add-Type compiling inline C# that imports Win32 APIs (DllImport of VirtualAlloc, CreateThread, kernel32/ntdll), a technique to run native shellcode or perform injection from PowerShell.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1059/001/
logsource:
  product: windows
  category: process_creation
detection:
  selection:
    CommandLine|contains: 'Add-Type'
    CommandLine|contains:
      - 'DllImport'
      - 'kernel32'
      - 'VirtualAlloc'
      - 'CreateThread'
  condition: selection
fields:
  - CommandLine
  - Image
  - ParentImage
falsepositives:
  - Developers compiling inline helpers
level: medium
tags:
  - attack.execution
  - attack.t1059.001
